React Summary
React builds fast, interactive UI using reusable components.

React is a JavaScript library used to make interactive user interfaces for web applications.
It helps us build reusable components and update the webpage without reloading the whole page.
This is called a single page application, where users can move between different pages easily.
React works on server and gives faster response.


JAVASCRIPT
Keyword: Logic Building

JavaScript is a programming language used to add logic to websites.
It helps us perform calculations, make decisions, handle events and control how a website works.


UI
Keyword: Visual Interaction Layer

UI (User Interface) is the visual part of a website that users interact with.
It includes buttons, images, text and forms, making it easier for users to use the application.



